1. Check if the subset of vertices is not empty (if vertices.isEmpty() == false)
2. Check if every pair of vertices in the subset is connected by an edge in the graph (for each v1 in vertices: for each v2 in vertices (v1 != v2), if graph.containsEdge(v1,v2) == false, return false)
